  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "[\"Actual unseen ventral curvature and back face remain inferred from bilateral ammonoid anatomy plus measured thickness, not four observed photographic angles.\", \"Node count, exact cross-section, and minor damage are simplified. Geiseltal shape and MHNT scale are different specimens; final references and description must disclose genus-level interpretation.\", \"Fossil mineral colour is artistic matte tan/grey. No claims of living colour, original shell surface or pristine mouth anatomy.\"] {\"unit\": \"metre\", \"target_X\": 0.115, \"target_Y\": 0.04, \"target_Z\": 0.14, \"evidence\": \"MHNT catalogued overall dimensions 140 x 115 x 40 mm. Long diameter maps Z, shorter in-plane span X, axial thickness Y. These are design dimensions based on a different identified individual, NOT measurements of Geiseltal photograph.\", \"tolerance\": \"About +/-10% simplified outline; thickness should remain near 0.29 of long diameter, not spherical or paper-flat. No inferred genus maximum.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：[\"Actual unseen ventral curvature and back face remain inferred from bilateral ammonoid anatomy plus measured thickness, not four observed photographic angles.\", \"Node count, exact cross-section, and minor damage are simplified. Geiseltal shape and MHNT scale are different specimens; final references and description must disclose genus-level interpretation.\", \"Fossil mineral colour is artistic matte tan/grey. No claims of living colour, original shell surface or pristine mouth anatomy.\"] {\"unit\": \"metre\", \"target_X\": 0.115, \"target_Y\": 0.04, \"target_Z\": 0.14, \"evidence\": \"MHNT catalogued overall dimensions 140 x 115 x 40 mm. Long diameter maps Z, shorter in-plane span X, axial thickness Y. These are design dimensions based on a different identified individual, NOT measurements of Geiseltal photograph.\", \"tolerance\": \"About +/-10% simplified outline; thickness should remain near 0.29 of long diameter, not spherical or paper-flat. No inferred genus maximum.\"}"
  },
